<text class="bd" x="64" y="1216" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84"># links to every PR: open "Full profile" below this image</text>

<text class="bd" x="64" y="1296.45" font-size="20"><tspan fill="#f1a349">~/zelinewang</tspan><tspan fill="#c6ad84"> $ ls tools/</tspan></text>
<text class="px" x="1136.17" y="1296.45" font-size="15.6" fill="#e97648" letter-spacing="2.836" text-anchor="end">§ 02 &#160;TOOLS I MAINTAIN</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1347.52" font-size="23.4" fill="#f1a349">claudemem</text>
<text class="bd" x="360" y="1347.52" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">local-first memory for coding agents; Markdown is the record</text>
<text class="bd" x="360" y="1374.52" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">↳ 11k lines of Go, 10k lines of tests, CI, release builds for 3 OSes</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1424.11" font-size="23.4" fill="#f1a349">handoff</text>
<text class="bd" x="360" y="1424.11" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">hands work from a lead model to cheaper ones via resumable specs</text>
<text class="bd" x="360" y="1451.11" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">↳ ships with a small-sample evaluation, including the run where it lost</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1500.71" font-size="23.4" fill="#f1a349">dev-orchestrator</text>
<text class="bd" x="360" y="1500.71" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">Claude Code plugin: investigate, test, verify, open the PR</text>
<text class="bd" x="360" y="1527.71" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">↳ the workflow below as a command, hooks, and file-backed state</text>
<text class="bd" x="64" y="1580" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84"># earlier experiments, hackathon-scale and labeled as such: FireSight · dipole · postprism</text>

<text class="bd" x="64" y="1659.57" font-size="20"><tspan fill="#f1a349">~/zelinewang</tspan><tspan fill="#c6ad84"> $ cat ~/.dev/how-i-work</tspan></text>
<text class="px" x="1136.17" y="1659.57" font-size="15.6" fill="#e97648" letter-spacing="2.836" text-anchor="end">§ 03 &#160;HOW I WORK</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1710.64" font-size="23.4" fill="#e97648">investigate</text><text class="bd" x="260" y="1710.64" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">gather evidence before forming a theory</text><text class="bd" x="820" y="1710.64" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">logs · code · docs</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1744.68" font-size="23.4" fill="#e97648">plan</text><text class="bd" x="260" y="1744.68" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">scope it, pick the reversible path</text><text class="bd" x="820" y="1744.68" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">cheapest signal first</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1778.72" font-size="23.4" fill="#e97648">execute</text><text class="bd" x="260" y="1778.72" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">write the failing test, then the fix</text><text class="bd" x="820" y="1778.72" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">red → green</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1812.77" font-size="23.4" fill="#e97648">verify</text><text class="bd" x="260" y="1812.77" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">independent review before anything merges</text><text class="bd" x="820" y="1812.77" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">no fake green</text>
<text class="px" x="63.83" y="1846.81" font-size="23.4" fill="#e97648">ship</text><text class="bd" x="260" y="1846.81" font-size="20" fill="#f8eed7">PR → CI → watch it in production</text><text class="bd" x="820" y="1846.81" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84">done = observed</text>
<text class="bd" x="64" y="1891" font-size="17" fill="#c6ad84"># the code behind this: dev-orchestrator (lifecycle) · handoff (delegation)</text>

<text class="bd" x="64" y="1970.21" font-size="20"><tspan fill="#f1a349">~/zelinewang</tspan><tspan fill="#c6ad84"> $ zane query --help</tspan></text>
